{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have you ever wanted to pile up your toys to make a track for your radio-controlled cars?\u00a0 <strong>Obstacle Overdrive</strong> offers room after room of tracks to explore that would ordinarily get you in trouble. \u00a0<strong>Parents not included.</strong>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Not a Racing Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the control of each car and take on crazy tracks filled with obstacles.\u00a0 Take your time and enjoy the challenge of each obstacle.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/gameplay_02.gif?t=1741905829\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Five Unique Cars</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each of the cars you unlock while playing has its own personality and driving style.\u00a0 See if you can beat every level with each car!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/carousel_01.gif?t=1741905829\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fun Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tumble down hills, go car bowling, drive over seesaws and log bridges, go through marble pits, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/physics_01.gif?t=1741905829\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Collect and Customize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover fun hats for the cars scattered throughout the game.\u00a0 Use coins to unlock new paint jobs to personalize each car.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/customization_01.gif?t=1741905829\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\